From bc1e5cbef461fb060de280847d5b791f12f815f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: msaeedlavasani <msaeedlavasani@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 21:09:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20complete=20Phase=201=20=E2=80=94=20Repo?=
 =?UTF-8?q?sitory,=20Service,=20Storage,=20Notification,=20Scheduler,=20Ou?=
 =?UTF-8?q?tbox?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add Repository Layer (7 repos: user, case, map, claim, cert, audit, ai)
- Add Service Layer (4 services: Case, Map, Claim, Cert)
- Add File Storage (MinIO: upload, download, presigned URL)
- Add Notification Service (In-App + SMS stub with rate limiting)
- Add Scheduler (deadline_2years, 5months, otp_cleanup)
- Add Outbox Pattern (migration 013, Publisher, Recorder)
- Refactor handlers to use service layer (remove direct DB queries)
- Add AuthHandler (extracted from main.go)
- Simplify main.go with dependency injection
- Add unit tests (state machine 10 + claim service 6 + scheduler 6)
- Add HANDOFF.md with project status and remaining tasks
---
